{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "a216d10b-e02d-409c-9c80-e62cb4ddf7bf", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 3, "ts": "2026-08-09T06:58:44.365000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "The changes are complete and the file is valid. Let me do a final check against the FSPI test app to make sure the command name still matches (the app uses `BOARDIOC_FSPI_TEST` = `BOARDIOC_USER`).\n\nThe app `fspi_test_main.c` defines `BOARDIOC_FSPI_TEST` as `BOARDIOC_USER` if not already defined, and calls `boardctl(BOARDIOC_FSPI_TEST, 0)`. My `board_ioctl` handles `command == BOARDIOC_FSPI_TEST` (which equals `BOARDIOC_USER`). This is kept unchanged as requested.\n\nLet me verify that the FSPI-related includes (`rk3576_fspi.h`, `nuttx/cache.h`, `string.h`, and the `FSPI_DELAY_US` define) are still fundamentally needed. The `rk3576_fspi_initialize` call in `board_app_initialize` uses `rk3576_fspi.h` under the `CONFIG_RK3576_FSPI` guard. Those includes are still relevant since `board_app_initialize` still calls `rk3576_fspi_initialize`. Good — no orphaned code.\n\nThe task is complete. Let me summarize the changes I made.\n\n## 变更总结\n\n我把 `kickpi_k7_appinit.c` 中原先用于 FSPI 波形测试的 `board_ioctl` 代码改成了调用 ST77916 LCD 驱动测试，同时保持了原有的 `BOARDIOC_FSPI_TEST`（即 `BOARDIOC_USER`）指令名不变。\n\n### 主要改动\n\n**1. ST77916 包含与声明修正（`kickpi_k7_appinit.c` 顶部）**\n- 修正了此前只带一个 `qspi` 参数的 `st77916_lcd_initialize` 前置声明，改为与驱动真实签名一致（`qspi, fmt, xres, yres, xoffset, yoffset, madctl`）。\n- 补充了 `nuttx/lcd/lcd.h`、`nuttx/kmalloc.h`、`nuttx/signal.h`、`syslog.h` 等依赖头文件。\n- 定义了面板几何参数（`ST77916_XRES=360`、`ST77916_YRES=390`、`FB_FMT_RGB16_565`）和 `CONFIG_LCD_MAXPOWER` 的安全默认值。\n- 新增静态全局句柄 `g_st77916_lcd`，供 ioctl 测试时推帧使用。\n- `BOARDIOC_FSPI_TEST` 宏保持不变，仍是 `BOARDIOC_USER`。\n\n**2. `board_app_initialize` 初始化 LCD**\n- 通过 `rk3576_fspi_initialize(1, 0)` 获取 QSPI 句柄，调用 `st77916_lcd_initialize(qspi, FB_FMT_RGB16_565, 360, 390, 0, 0, 0)` 初始化整块 360x390 面板，并保存返回的 `lcd_dev_s *` 设备句柄。\n\n**3. `board_ioctl` 由 FSPI 测试改为 LCD 测试**\n- 移除原来的 WREN/RDID/DMA 写等 FSPI 探针代码。\n- 现在收到 `BOARDIOC_FSPI_TEST` 指令时：先 `setpower` 点亮面板，然后在屏幕上依次整屏填充 红→绿→蓝→白→黑 五个纯色帧（各停留 300ms），通过 `putarea` 一次推全屏，任何接线或 QSPI 传输问题都会立刻在面板上显现。\n- 指令名与原先保持一致，应用层 `fspi_test` 程序无需改动即可复用。\n\n`kickpi_k7_appinit.c` 已通过静态检查，无编译错误。\n\n需要说明的是：物理面板的分辨率以驱动实际 GRAM（360x390）为准，若实际模组尺寸不同（例如 390x360），只需调整 `ST77916_XRES`/`ST77916_YRES` 或相应的 `xoffset`/`yoffset` 即可。"}
